"""
AstroManager - Filter Database
====================================
Comprehensive database of 1612 astrophotography filters with wavelength and bandwidth.
Covers LRGB, narrowband (SHO, NII, Hb), hydrogen Balmer series (Ha through Homega),
emission lines (OI, OII, SIII, HeI, HeII, Fe, Ne, Ar, C, N, Si, Mg),
Johnson-Cousins photometric (UBVRI), Sloan/SDSS, Bessel, Stromgren, Washington,
Gunn, 2MASS, Gaia, Geneva, DDO, Vilnius, Hipparcos, WISE, Spitzer, GALEX,
HST/WFC3, HST/ACS, JWST/NIRCam, JWST/MIRI,
dual-band (IDAS NBZ/NB3, Optolong L-eNhance/eXtreme/Ultimate), multiband,
light pollution (CLS, UHC, IDAS LPS), solar (DayStar, Baader, ERF),
planetary (IR pass, UV, methane, color), spectroscopy lines (Paschen, Brackett, Lyman, Pfund),
neutral density (ND2-ND1000), interference filters, Schott glass, comet filters,
survey photometry (CFHT, HSC, DECam, APASS, TESS, Kepler, Swift, XMM),
and branded filters (ZWO, Baader, Chroma, Astronomik, Antlia, Optolong, Celestron,
Lumicon, DayStar, Radian Raptor, Explore Scientific, Player One, SVBONY, Altair,
Askar, Meade, Sightron, STC, Thousand Oaks, Hutech/IDAS, Skywatcher, Orion,
Custom Scientific, Thorlabs, Edmund Optics, Omega Optical, Semrock).
"""

